---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Support | Collator"
description: "Get help with Collator: contact us directly, browse common questions, or suggest a feature."
ogTitle: "Support | Collator"
ogDescription: "Get help with Collator: contact us directly, browse common questions, or suggest a feature."
ogUrl: "https://collator.app/support"
ctaHref: "/#download"
activePage: "support"
permalink: "/support/"
---
<!-- Page header -->
<section class="bg-canvas pt-14">
  <div class="max-w-[640px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 pt-12 pb-6">
    <p class="label-overline text-muted mb-3">Help</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif font-normal text-[2.5rem] leading-[1.15] text-ink mb-3">How can we help?</h1>
    <p class="text-dim text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80">We're a small team and read every message ourselves. Here's how to reach us, and answers to the questions we hear most.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Contact -->
<section class="bg-canvas px-6 md:px-8 pb-4">
  <div class="max-w-[640px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-8">

    <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
      <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
        {% icon "mail", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-[.9375rem] text-ink mb-2">Email us</h3>
      <p class="text-muted text-[.8125rem] leading-relaxed mb-4">For anything else, including account or purchase issues. We aim to reply within 24 hours.</p>
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}" class="text-saffron hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors text-[.9375rem] font-medium">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
      <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
        {% icon "message-circle", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-[.9375rem] text-ink mb-2">Suggest a feature</h3>
      <p class="text-muted text-[.8125rem] leading-relaxed mb-4">Tell us what's missing, vote on ideas, or see what's coming next.</p>
      <a href="{{ site.userjot.feedback }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-saffron hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors text-[.9375rem] font-medium">collator.userjot.com</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="bg-canvas px-6 md:px-8 pb-20">
  <div class="max-w-[640px] mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-semibold text-[1.125rem] text-ink mt-6 mb-2">Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <div class="divide-y divide-hair">

      <details class="group py-4">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="text-ink text-[.9375rem] font-medium">How do I add something to my vault?</span>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "w-4 h-4 text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" %}
        </summary>
        <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-3">
          Tap the add button and choose a category, document, asset, person or custody note. Fill in what you know now; you can always come back and add more later.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-4">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="text-ink text-[.9375rem] font-medium">Where is my data stored?</span>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "w-4 h-4 text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" %}
        </summary>
        <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-3">
          On your device, and only your device. Collator doesn't have a server, so there's nothing for us to see, lose or hand over. Read more on our <a href="/privacy" class="text-saffron hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors">privacy page</a>.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-4">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="text-ink text-[.9375rem] font-medium">What happens if I lose my phone?</span>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "w-4 h-4 text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" %}
        </summary>
        <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-3">
          If you have iCloud or Google account backup turned on, restoring your new phone from that backup brings your vault back too. This is why we recommend keeping device backups on, since we can't recover anything ourselves.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-4">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="text-ink text-[.9375rem] font-medium">Can I get my data out of Collator?</span>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "w-4 h-4 text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" %}
        </summary>
        <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-3">
          Yes. Use the export option in the app to take a copy of your records whenever you want. Export and import are free, always, even after the trial ends.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-4">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="text-ink text-[.9375rem] font-medium">Is there a subscription?</span>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "w-4 h-4 text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" %}
        </summary>
        <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-3">
          No. Collator starts with a free trial. After that, viewing, editing, importing and exporting your existing records stay free forever, adding new records needs a single one-time purchase. No recurring charges, ever.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-4">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="text-ink text-[.9375rem] font-medium">How do I restore my purchase on a new device?</span>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "w-4 h-4 text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" %}
        </summary>
        <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-3">
          Open Settings inside the app and choose Restore Purchases, while signed in with the same Apple ID or Google account you originally purchased with.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-4">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="text-ink text-[.9375rem] font-medium">How do I delete my information?</span>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "w-4 h-4 text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" %}
        </summary>
        <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-3">
          Delete individual records from within the app at any time, or uninstall Collator to remove everything stored locally. Whether a copy remains in your personal device backup is controlled by your iCloud or Google account settings.
        </p>
      </details>

    </div>

    <p class="text-dim text-[.9375rem] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-8">
      Didn't find what you're looking for? Email us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}" class="text-saffron hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a> and we'll help directly.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
